    "name": "Street Crime Mission",
    "steam_appid": 3401880,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udea8 <strong>DRIVE \u2022 SHOOT \u2022 RESCUE</strong> \u2014 <i>Street Crime Mission</i> drops you into a high-octane <strong>police FPS</strong> where every mission begins with a siren and ends in shattered glass. Tackle urban chaos across \u2733\ufe0f <strong>12 story missions</strong> that fuse break-neck <strong>car chases</strong> with tight first-person gunfights.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udca5 What\u2019s Inside</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfce\ufe0f <strong>Hybrid gameplay</strong> \u2013 swap instantly between high-speed pursuits &amp; precision gunplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f <strong>Diverse crime scenes</strong> \u2013 airports, hospitals, banks, schools, ships &amp; downtown streets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Mission variety</strong> \u2013 stop drunk drivers, raid prison breaks, defuse terrorist sieges, guard VIPs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd16 <strong>Adaptive AI</strong> \u2013 enemies change tactics; you improvise or fail.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>Steam Achievements &amp; cloud saves</strong> \u2013 prove your skills anywhere.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you crave <strong>police action</strong>, <strong>car-chase thrills</strong>, and <strong>single-player FPS</strong> heat, hit that <strong>\ud83c\udd95 Add to Wishlist</strong> button and be first on the scene!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udea8 <strong>DRIVE \u2022 SHOOT \u2022 RESCUE</strong> \u2014 <i>Street Crime Mission</i> drops you into a high-octane <strong>police FPS</strong> where every mission begins with a siren and ends in shattered glass. Tackle urban chaos across \u2733\ufe0f <strong>12 story missions</strong> that fuse break-neck <strong>car chases</strong> with tight first-person gunfights.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udca5 What\u2019s Inside</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfce\ufe0f <strong>Hybrid gameplay</strong> \u2013 swap instantly between high-speed pursuits &amp; precision gunplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f <strong>Diverse crime scenes</strong> \u2013 airports, hospitals, banks, schools, ships &amp; downtown streets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Mission variety</strong> \u2013 stop drunk drivers, raid prison breaks, defuse terrorist sieges, guard VIPs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd16 <strong>Adaptive AI</strong> \u2013 enemies change tactics; you improvise or fail.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>Steam Achievements &amp; cloud saves</strong> \u2013 prove your skills anywhere.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you crave <strong>police action</strong>, <strong>car-chase thrills</strong>, and <strong>single-player FPS</strong> heat, hit that <strong>\ud83c\udd95 Add to Wishlist</strong> button and be first on the scene!</p>",
    "short_description": "\ud83d\ude93\u26a1\ufe0f Police FPS meets car-chase mayhem! Pursue drunk drivers, smash street racers, raid hijacked ships, rescue hostages and escort the President across 12 adrenaline missions. Drive hard, shoot fast\u2014restore order to the city! \ud83d\udd2b\ud83d\ude94",
